+ * @window: A #MetaWindow
+ * @struts: (transfer full) (element-type MetaStrut): The new struts
+ *
+ * Replaces the struts of a window whose struts are not read from window
+ * properties (e.g. Wayland layer surfaces), and invalidates the work areas.
